{"id":"n29614-1-3","stage":0,"title":"여섯 · 六","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29614-1-3-1","ko":"얘야. 새해가 됐는데 올해 몇 살이니?","zh":"孩子，新年到了，你今年几岁呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얘야.","meaning":"孩子呀","explanation":"얘：由 이 아이 缩略而来，用于亲近地称呼孩子；-야 是呼格助词。","readings":[{"term":"얘","audio":"/audio/1ad358ceb1fa5d832807.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67258","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얘야","audio":"/audio/b841046bdd22c12eff10.mp3"}},{"text":"새해가","meaning":"新年","explanation":"새해：新年；-가 标记主语。새해가 되다 是“新年来到”。","readings":[{"term":"새해","audio":"/audio/9131dc433c64dfce6c01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67897","senseId":"1","lemma":"새해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새해가","audio":"/audio/9581df025e5c51c751c0.mp3"}},{"text":"됐는데","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐는데","audio":"/audio/2716758969d5de657c79.mp3"}},{"text":"올해","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"살이니?","meaning":"岁","explanation":"살：岁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67887","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","ori